ce. No drugs, no alcohol. No phones.**\n\n**Details in telegram group:**\n**t.me/TorontoTantra**\n\n**TICKETS**\n**Regular Ticket — $50 CAD**\n**Early Bird Ticket — $35 CAD (If you register and pay before August 31).**\n**Supportive Ticket — $25 CAD (For students and people with low financial income).**\n**Combo — $60 CAD for 2 people (Bring a friend).**\n\n**Free participation.**\n**We want everyone to have an opportunity to participate. If the price is too much for you, send a personal message on Telegram: t.me/AndyTherapist to ask about volunteer options.**\n\n**If you have any questions, feel free to message:**\n**t.me/AndyTherapist**\n**t.me/TorontoTantra**","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-tantra-circle/events/316727876/","isAttending":false,"isSaved":false,"maxTickets":0,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535612879"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535612879"},"feeSettings":null,"group":{"__ref":"Group:37678460"},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":1,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:339669683"}}}]},"series":{"__typename":"Series","description":"Every week on Friday, Saturday, Sunday","weeklyRecurrence":{"__typename":"WeeklyRecurrenceInfo","weeklyDaysOfWeek":["FRIDAY","SUNDAY","SATURDAY"],"weeklyInterval":1},"monthlyRecurrence":null,"events({\"numberOfEvents\":5,\"startDate\":\"2026-10-02\"})":{"__typename":"SeriesEventConnection","edges":[{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316160155"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316560141"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316629411"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316641935"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316656988"}}]}},"venue":null},"RecommendedEventsEdge:{\"node\":{\"id\":\"316727876\"}}":{"__typename":"RecommendedEventsEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:31672787